# X4 Foundations deploy configuration
# Copy this file to deploy.config (or run `make setup`) and set your X4 install folder.
# The mod is synced into <X4_PATH>/extensions/<id from content.xml>.
#
# The same file works from WSL and PowerShell: a Windows path (E:\...) is converted
# automatically under WSL. Quotes are optional. The X4_PATH environment variable
# overrides this file.
#
# Examples:
#   Windows / WSL: E:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\X4 Foundations
#   Linux:         /home/username/.steam/steam/steamapps/common/X4 Foundations
#   macOS:         /Users/username/Library/Application Support/Steam/steamapps/common/X4 Foundations

X4_PATH="E:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\X4 Foundations"
